{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-3132cb21", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2404.06204 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2404.06204 targets 2 physics processes:\n\n1. \\( pp \\rightarrow W \\rightarrow l \\nu \\) (W boson production and leptonic decay)\n2. \\( pp \\rightarrow Z/\\gamma^* \\rightarrow l^+ l^- \\) (Z boson production and decay to charged lepton pairs)\n\nThis information is supported by the following assertions from the paper:\n\n- For \\( pp \\rightarrow W \\rightarrow l \\nu \\): \"pp -> W -> l nu (W boson production and leptonic decay)\"\n- For \\( pp \\rightarrow Z/\\gamma^* \\rightarrow l^+ l^- \\): \"pp -> Z/gamma* -> l+ l- (Z boson production and decay to charged lepton pairs)\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2404.06204 targets 2 distinct physics processes.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2404.06204 targets 2 physics processes: 1. \\( pp \\\\rightarrow W \\\\rightarrow l \\\\nu \\\\) (W boson production and leptonic decay) 2. \\( pp \\\\rightarrow Z/\\\\gamma^* \\\\rightarrow l^+ l^- \\\\) (Z boson production and decay to charged lepton pairs).\", \"papers_from\": \"\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2404.06204"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2404.06204"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:pp-w-lnu", "hepkg:process:pp-z-ll"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:102c82d47f91a97de84291bd", "hepkg:evidence:9254924b6a75a205720e1158", "hepkg:evidence:e0963692a9cbd7b97896993b", "hepkg:evidence:ea95387b47606ecd87028ac5"], "seen_values": ["2404.06204", "and", "