{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-44711e73", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2604.21670 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2604.21670 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- Diboson cross-section theoretical uncertainty\n- Electron and muon reconstruction, identification, trigger efficiency and energy scale/resolution uncertainties\n- Flavour tagging uncertainty\n- Higgs boson branching ratio uncertainty\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale and resolution uncertainty\n- Pile-up modelling uncertainty\n- Single top theoretical modelling uncertainty\n- Tau-lepton reconstruction/identification uncertainty\n- WW modelling uncertainty\n- Z+jets modelling uncertainty\n- \\( t\\bar{t} \\) modelling (theory) uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2604.21670 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\\n\\n- Diboson cross-section theoretical uncertainty\\n- Electron and muon reconstruction, identification, trigger efficiency and energy scale/resolution uncertainties\\n- Flavour tagging uncertainty\\n- Higgs boson branching ratio uncertainty\\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\\n- Jet energy scale and resolution uncertainty\\n- Pile-up modelling uncertainty\\n- Single top theoretical modelling uncertainty\\n- Tau-lepton reconstruction/identification uncertainty\\n- WW modelling uncertainty\\n- Z+jets modelling uncertainty\\n- \\( t\\\\bar{t} \\\\) modelling (theory) uncertainty\\n\\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis.\", \"papers_from\": \"\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293",