{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-50d9a8e1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which statistical methods does analysis 2510.07527 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2510.07527 uses the following statistical methods:\n\n- Asymptotic profile likelihood ratio test statistic \\(-2\\Delta\\ln(L)\\) with CLs criterion\n- Barlow-Beeston approach for MC statistical uncertainties in the likelihood\n- CMS Combine statistical analysis tool (RooFit/RooStats frameworks)\n- Global (statistically combined) maximum likelihood fit across analyses\n\nThese methods are used to analyze the data and derive the results presented in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2106.14246", "2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2510.07527"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.03}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:statmethod:barlow_beeston", "hepkg:statmethod:combine_roofit_roostats", "hepkg:statmethod:global_ml_fit", "hepkg:statmethod:profile_likelihood_asymptotic_cls"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:45799591c5678819809a38e9", "hepkg:evidence:558c565c896955ed045a47a9", "hepkg:evidence:865f61aab89ce5d64c860c3c", "hepkg:evidence:c391f2b439b26cb0cccd4f11"], "seen_values": ["2", "2510.07527", "across", "analyses", "analysis", "approach", "asymptotic", "barlow-beeston", "cls", "cms", "combine", "combined", "criterion", "fit", "for", "frameworks", "global", "hepkg:statmethod:barlow_beeston", "hepkg:statmethod:combine_roofit_roostats", "hepkg:statmethod:global_ml_fit", "hepkg:statmethod:profile_likelihood_asymptotic_cls", "likelihood", "maximum", "profile", "ratio", "result_uses_statistical_method", "roofit", "roostats", "statistic", "statistical", "statistical_method", "statistically", "test", "the", "tool", "u