{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-573ed505", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects do the regions of analysis 2309.14442 require?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The regions of analysis 2309.14442 require the following detector objects:\n\n- Jet, detector level (anti-kT R=0.4, PF)\n- Jet, particle level (anti-kT R=0.4, excluding neutrinos)\n- Light jet, particle level (not matched to b hadron)\n- Light-tagged jet, detector level (fails DeepJet medium WP)\n- Particle-level (dressed) electron\n- Particle-level (dressed) muon\n- Primary (signal) electron, detector level\n- Primary (signal) muon, detector level\n- b jet, particle level (matched to b hadron)\n- b-tagged jet, detector level, DeepJet medium working point\n\nThese objects are required for defining the event regions in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2303.15340", "2309.14442", "2402.08486"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2309.14442"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:bjet_medium_detector", "hepkg:object:bjet_particle", "hepkg:object:electron_particle", "hepkg:object:electron_signal_detector", "hepkg:object:jet_detector", "hepkg:object:jet_particle", "hepkg:object:lightjet_medium_detector", "hepkg:object:lightjet_particle", "hepkg:object:muon_particle", "hepkg:object:muon_signal_detector"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:18e067deb02d96514e41759f", "hepkg:evidence:1f5c37db659c5308476e0655", "hepkg:evidence:4ffbd8cf76c75445fbfb8559", "hepkg:evidence:bdf1de1deefb564ffea5e190"], "seen_values": ["0.4", "2309.14442", "anti-kt", "b-tagged", "deepjet", "detector", "detector_object", "dressed", "electron", "excluding", "fails", "hadron", "hepkg:object:bjet_medium_detector", "hepk