{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-6ad16f6e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which generators does analysis 2506.13565 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2506.13565 uses the following generators:\n\n- MadGraph5_aMC@NLO\n- POWHEG 2.0\n- Pythia 8\n\nThis information is supported by the following assertions from the paper:\n\n- For MadGraph5_aMC@NLO: \"The signal samples are produced using the MadGraph5_aMC@NLO generator.\"\n- For POWHEG 2.0: \"The background samples are generated using POWHEG 2.0.\"\n- For Pythia 8: \"The parton shower and hadronization are performed using Pythia 8.\"", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2009.04363", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2506.13565"], "predicate": "sample_uses_generator"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:generator:madgraph5-amcnlo", "hepkg:generator:powheg", "hepkg:generator:pythia8"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:691821af7f885a0fe813ae15", "hepkg:evidence:7de22d3c3ae60dd4598979f6", "hepkg:evidence:ad8957e16dad8bb72d64f65f", "hepkg:evidence:c5ff576d4c68c56b2247f989"], "seen_values": ["2", "2.0", "2506.13565", "8", "generator", "hepkg:generator:madgraph5-amcnlo", "hepkg:generator:powheg", "hepkg:generator:pythia8", "madgraph5_amc", "nlo", "powheg", "pythia", "sample_uses_generator"], "ve