{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-c27e2cd3", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2604.27044 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2604.27044 measures the following observables:\n\n- HH production signal strength (μ_HH)\n- HHVV coupling modifier (κ_2V)\n- Higgs boson trilinear self-coupling modifier (κ_λ)\n- ZH→4b signal strength (μ_ZH)\n- ZZ→4b signal strength (μ_ZZ)\n- ggHH production signal strength (μ_ggHH)\n- qqHH (VBF HH) production signal strength (μ_qqHH)\n\nThese observables are related to the production and decay of the Higgs boson in various processes.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2604.27044"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:kappa-2V", "hepkg:observable:kappa-lambda", "hepkg:observable:mu-HH", "hepkg:observable:mu-ZH", "hepkg:observable:mu-ZZ", "hepkg:observable:mu-ggHH", "hepkg:observable:mu-qqHH"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:00bd4aa031b31fca193e7e37", "hepkg:evidence:058cbe497dc967033cc132c9", "hepkg:evidence:0851ad69e4de06066d186ea6", "hepkg:evidence:085f7b0bfc9fb9603c0369d6", "hepkg:evidence:14bc45fb979ac9c141fb34a3", "hepkg:evidence:175ba7ffed823680e0ea44b3", "hepkg:evidence:47641113c3ae6815b28841a2", "hepkg:evidence:4dbd845fbb2fa38733979052", "hepkg:evidence:4e00f481ea82aa9cbdeb2ca3", "hepkg:evidence:4fa1a71454e539d7baed76ae", "hepkg:evidence:56b72c86af3e24e45d8f3e15", "hepkg:evidence:5a06e352e74bc74e3a163542", "hepkg:evidence:7a0d6aa522ce48c5b2aa4d73", "hepkg:evidence:80275576ef4a44aac3de834a", "hepkg:evidence:85f159557f729facb13aaeb4", "hepkg:evidence:87df680b91ec274c4a89b120", "hepkg:evidence:89954fc866c96698c98e486f", "hepkg:evidence:93