{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-da0c6a94", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2006.05880 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2006.05880 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- $t\\bar{t}$ MC sample\n- $t\\bar{t}H$ simulated sample\n- Diboson $VV\\ (V=W,Z)$ MC sample\n- SUSY signal MC sample (direct top-squark pair production, t1t1 and t2t2)\n- Single-top, Wt MC sample\n- Triboson $VVV\\ (V=W,Z)$ MC sample\n- Wh, Zh MC sample\n- tWZ MC sample\n- tZ MC sample\n- ttWW, tttt MC sample\n- ttZ/gamma*, ttW MC sample\n- ttt MC sample\n\nThese samples are used to simulate various processes and backgrounds in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2009.04363", "2102.01444", "2107.12553", "2202.08676", "2307.01094", "2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2006.05880"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:diboson-mc", "hepkg:sample:singletop-wt-mc", "hepkg:sample:susy-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:tWZ-mc", "hepkg:sample:tZ-mc", "hepkg:sample:triboson-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttWW-tttt-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttZ-ttW-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttbar-mc", "hepkg:sample:tth-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttt-mc", "hepkg:sample:wh-zh-mc"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:13416c323ebca3712280ee8b", "hepkg:evidence:326d50ddaa450c70c0ebf5d5", "hepkg:evidence:3cce2af8070bb080dee7ab70", "hepkg:evidence:51c51f1908980993c761e40f", "hepkg:evidence:541bcf78ed409fa9fd509da7", "hepkg:evidence:5d984f3caa850f4b2ad8b1f7", "hepkg:evidence:630b49595ee232e597b4568b", "hepkg:evidence:73d8844f1199f30570208858", "hepkg:evidence:7a642cbe08cd5cd8b381733f", "hepkg:evidence:b1425dffdd50cf86560072ba", "hepkg:evidence:b4cf2aa7b24feb4626037fdc", "hepkg:evidence:cc