{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-eb22d947", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2106.14246 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2106.14246 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)\n- 3ℓA parametric neural-network discriminant regions\n- 3ℓA search regions, M_ll in Z window (A23–A64)\n- 3ℓA search regions, M_ll off Z window (A01–A22)\n- 3ℓB search regions (B01–B03)\n- 3ℓC search regions (C01–C09)\n- 3ℓD search regions (D01–D16)\n- 3ℓE search regions (E01–E09)\n- 3ℓF search regions (F01–F12)\n- 4ℓG search regions (G01–G05)\n- 4ℓH–4ℓK shared search regions (X01–X03)\n- Common baseline selection for three-lepton categories (3ℓA–3ℓF)\n- WZ control region (3ℓA-based)\n- ZZ control region (4ℓG-based)\n- Zγ control region (3ℓA-based, inverted)\n- ttZ-enriched control region (3ℓA-based + b jet)\n\nThese regions are used to define the various channels in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2106.14246"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2106.14246"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.049}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:2lss_sr", "hepkg:region:3lA_nn", "hepkg:region:3lA_offz_sr", "hepkg:region:3lA_onz_sr", "hepkg:region:3lB_sr", "hepkg:region:3lC_sr", "hepkg:region:3lD_sr", "hepkg:region:3lE_sr", "hepkg:region:3lF_sr", "hepkg:region:4lG_sr", "hepkg:region:4lHIJK_sr", "hepkg:region:three_lepton_baseline", "hepkg:region:ttz_cr", "hepkg:region:wz_cr", "hepkg:region:zg_cr", "hepkg:region:zz_cr"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:014807a65d2a1f4f671f0b12", "hepkg:evidence:0df88a3969742a59ff662311", "hepkg:evidence:1d3d5bfb8a66485834bcf26f", "hepkg:evidence:2cc7fee5242a343b9d09d6ec", "hepkg:evidence:3