{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-f9b2014d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects do the regions of analysis 2103.04956 require?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The regions of analysis 2103.04956 require the following detector objects:\n\n- Jet\n- Lepton (electron or muon)\n- Z boson candidate (dilepton system)\n- b-tagged jet\n\nThis information is supported by the following assertions from the paper:\n\n- \"The signal region requires at least one jet.\"\n- \"The signal region requires at least one lepton (electron or muon).\"\n- \"The signal region requires a Z boson candidate (dilepton system).\"\n- \"The signal region requires at least one b-tagged jet.\"\n\nThese requirements are specific to the regions defined in this analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.04956"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.052}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:b_jet", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:lepton", "hepkg:object:z_candidate"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:03eb6149d9ea0ad6350f1e35", "hepkg:evidence:0c4218e7d995b9cd83af7057", "hepkg:evidence:1a443df580cf35f3e7b2f5b6", "hepkg:evidence:2290