{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-79c3b5a8", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many event regions do the channels of analysis 2402.08486 contain?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2402.08486 contains 5 event regions in its channels:\n\n- Detector-level dilepton ttbar signal region (baseline event selection)\n- Detector-level extra-jet definition region for N_jet measurement\n- Particle-level extra-jet definition region for N_jet measurement\n- Particle-level fiducial phase space for dilepton ttbar cross sections\n- Parton-level full phase space for top quark/ttbar kinematic observables\n\nThese regions define the different parts of the phase space where the analysis measures various observables.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2402.08486"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2402.08486"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:detector_extra_jets", "hepkg:region:detector_sr_dilepton", "hepkg:region:particle_extra_jets", "hepkg:region:particle_fiducial_dilepton", "hepkg:region:parton_full_phase_space"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0bdb9a05ee195980bf25bf0f", "hepkg:evidence:416a866c7b74421e8636116d", "hepkg:evidence:6ed61b1318ee5940083c8200", "hepkg:evidence:86da8334df2a4b2538379e0a", "hepkg:evidence:9a03ad0f957b5784a7a77c1e"], "seen_values": ["2402.08486", "baseline", "channel_has_region", "cross", "definition", "detector-level", "dilepton", "event", "event_region", "extra-jet", "fiducial", "for", "full", "hepkg:region:detector_extra_jets", "hepkg:region:detector_sr_dilepton", "hepkg:region:particle_extra_jets", "hepkg:region:particle_fiducial_dilepton", "hepkg:region:parton_full_phase_space", "kinematic", "measurement", "n_jet", "observables", "particle-leve