{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-c2806613", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many quantities does analysis 2010.14293 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2010.14293 reports 12 distinct quantities, including exclusions for gluino and squark masses, and the maximum local discrepancy in validation regions. \n\nHere are the quantities:\n\n- Gluino mass exclusion for massless neutralino: 2220 GeV\n- Gluino mass exclusion for most favourable X (mass-splitting ratio): 2210 GeV\n- Gluino mass lower limit for small neutralino masses: 2300 GeV\n- Maximum local discrepancy in validation regions: 2.6 sigma\n- Neutralino and gluino mass exclusion near diagonal: 900 GeV\n- Neutralino and squark mass exclusion near diagonal: 600 GeV\n- Neutralino mass exclusion at fixed squark mass 1300 GeV: 800 GeV\n- Neutralino mass exclusion near diagonal at gluino mass ~1000 GeV: 950 GeV\n- Neutralino mass exclusion using optimised BDT regions at gluino mass ~1700 GeV: 1160 GeV\n- Squark mass exclusion for massless neutralino: 1310 GeV\n- Squark mass exclusion for most favourable X (mass-splitting ratio): 1350 GeV\n\nThese quantities are derived from the analysis reported in the paper.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2010.14293 reports 12 distinct quantities, including exclusions for gluino and squark masses, and the maximum local discrepancy in validation regions. Here are the quantities:\\n\\n- Gluino mass exclusion for massless neutralino: 2220 GeV\\n- Gluino mass exclusion for most favourable X (mass-splitting ratio): 2210 GeV\\n- Gluino mass lower limit for small neutralino masses: 2300 GeV\\n- Maximum local discrepancy in validation regions: 2.6 sigma\\n- Neutralino and gluino mass exclusion near diagonal: 900 GeV\\n- Neutralino and squark mass exclusion near diagona