{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-c5f59f53", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2207.00348 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2207.00348 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- Electroweak vector boson fusion Higgs boson production (VBF)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a single top quark (tH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a top quark pair (ttH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a vector boson (VH)\n- WH associated production\n- ZH associated production (qq/qg→ZH, gg→ZH)\n- bbH production (Higgs boson production in association with a bb pair)\n- Gluon-gluon fusion (ggF) Higgs boson production\n- tHW production\n- tHqb production", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956", "2207.00348", "2504.13081", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.00348"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:bbh", "hepkg:process:ggf", "hepkg:process:th", "hepkg:process:thqb", "hepkg:process:thw", "hepkg:process:tth", "hepkg:process:vbf", "hepkg:process:vh", "hepkg:process:wh", "hepkg:process:zh"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:14635c80d8f10aa2ca382e79", "hepkg:evidence:14fba303805398e44c40aac8", "hepkg:evidence:195450bd9d9c550af8dab605", "hepkg:evidence:1f9455681c699f9c07937a35", "hepkg:evidence:b068f8d0457bc61bc552c544", "hepkg:evidence:d93e496aaa7424c1696d686f", "hepkg:evidence:e862333290598aa0903d411d", "hepkg:evidence:eaca5fe2d84206a85e79b139"], "seen_values": ["2207.00348", "associated", "association", "bbh", "boson", "electroweak", "fusion", "ggf", "gluon-gluon", "hepkg:process:bbh", "hepkg:process:ggf", "hepkg:process:th", "hepkg:process:thqb", "hepkg:pro