{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-cd43f3b0", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2211.08028 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2211.08028 defines 22 region selection requirements. These include various thresholds on effective mass (\\(m_{\\text{eff}}\\)), minimum transverse mass of b-jets (\\(m_{T,\\text{min}}^{\\text{b-jets}}\\)), sum of jet masses (\\(M_J^\\Sigma\\)), and neural network output scores for different processes (Gbb and Gtt).\n\nHere are the specific requirements:\n\n- \\(P(Gbb) \\geq 0.997\\) (neural-network output score)\n- \\(P(Gbb) \\geq 0.999\\) (neural-network output score)\n- \\(P(Gbb) \\geq 0.9993\\) (neural-network output score)\n- \\(P(Gbb) \\geq 0.9994\\) (neural-network output score)\n- \\(P(Gtt) \\geq 0.9987\\) (neural-network output score)\n- \\(P(Gtt) \\geq 0.9993\\) (neural-network output score)\n- \\(P(Gtt) \\geq 0.9997\\) (neural-network output score)\n- \\(m_{\\text{eff}} > 1300 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), \\(m_{T,\\text{min}}^{\\text{b-jets}} > 130 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), \\(M_J^\\Sigma > 50 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(m_{\\text{eff}} > 1600 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), \\(m_{T,\\text{min}}^{\\text{b-jets}} > 130 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), leading jet \\(p_T > 30 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(m_{\\text{eff}} > 2000 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), \\(m_{T,\\text{min}}^{\\text{b-jets}} > 130 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), \\(M_J^\\Sigma > 200 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(m_{\\text{eff}} > 2000 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), \\(m_{T,\\text{min}}^{\\text{b-jets}} > 130 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), leading jet \\(p_T > 30 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(m_{\\text{eff}} > 2500 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), \\(m_{T,\\text{min}}^{\\text{b-jets}} > 130 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), \\(M_J^\\Sigma > 200 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(m_{\\text{eff}} > 2600 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), \\(m_{T,\\text{min}}^{\\text{b-jets}} > 130 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), leading jet \\(p_T > 65 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(m_{\\text{eff}} \\geq 1100 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), \\(m_T \\geq 200 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), \\(m_{T,\\text{min}}^{\\text{b-jets}} \\geq 120 \\, \\text{GeV}\\), \\(M_J^\\Sigma \\geq 100 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(m_{\\text{eff}} \\geq 1100 \\", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2211.08028"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:091a574d9c30def701535872", "hepkg:evidence:0a0e19f8fa40faea7ef54615", "hepkg:evidence:3c8bab70653541924d3b8306", "hepkg:evidence:3e12434c26fa47a160421d63", "hepkg:evidence:41f212bb1354b92f693c2056", "hepkg:evidence:4f4d69490d97426aa78c2cc6", "hepkg:evidence:5a7796d01737dced5e2da2d5", "hepkg:evidence:5d6d3a3b7682223c118163dd", "hepkg:evidence:67c380d0728fb63b208b60c3", "hepkg:evidence:7f95eafc0ce0d1d388a17741", "hepkg:evidence:97299efdcd938d3d57942f87", "hepkg:evidence:99826c6111240c77737f50ba", "hepkg:evidence:a1a7f1a3c3eceda1a66b8502", "hepkg:evidence:a52d84b4a700f24426b9212c", "hepkg:evidence:b0060e2552b7f3ac3fe3d7a2", "hepkg:evidence:b8ab425644f1108f568e4e45", "hepkg:evidence:c501131f44fbd6a7d1e2428b", "hepkg:evidence:cbd2a23065e2318add91cf55", "hepkg:evidence:d25e89513d8636d7a15e41a5", "hepkg:evidence:eb7608c00f4487b2e522881f", "hepkg:evidence:fa1f67ea82fded0cb1284b11"], "seen_values": ["0.4", "0.997", "0.9987", "0.999", "0.9993", "0.9994", "0.9997", "1", "100", "11", "1100", "12", "120", "13", "130", "1300", "15", "150", "16", "1600", "17", "1700", "18", "180", "2", "200", "2000", "2211.08028", "23", "2300", "25", "2500", "26", "2600", "29", "2900", "3", "30", "300", "4", "5", "50", "65", "8", "800", "b-jets", "delta", "gbb", "gev", "gtt", "jet", "leading", "m_eff", "m_j", "m_t", "min", "neural-network", "none", "output", "phi_min", "region_has_selection", "score", "sigma"