{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-1d8e8354", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2506.13565 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2506.13565 targets 2 physics processes:\n\n1. \\( b \\rightarrow s \\ell^+\\ell^- \\) flavor-changing neutral current transition\n2. \\( q\\bar{q} \\rightarrow \\ell^+\\ell^- \\) via \\( bb\\ell\\ell \\) four-fermion contact interaction\n\nThese processes are identified by the following IDs:\n- hepkg:process:b-to-s-ll-fcnc\n- hepkg:process:qq-to-ll-ci\n\nThe information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n1. \"The analysis targets the \\( b \\rightarrow s \\ell^+\\ell^- \\) flavor-changing neutral current transition.\"\n2. \"The analysis also targets the \\( q\\bar{q} \\rightarrow \\ell^+\\ell^- \\) process via the \\( bb\\ell\\ell \\) four-fermion contact interaction.\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2506.13565 targets 2 distinct physics processes.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2506.13565 targets 2 physics processes: 1. \\( b \\\\rightarrow s \\\\ell^+\\\\ell^- \\\\) flavor-changing neutral current transition 2. \\( q\\\\bar{q} \\\\rightarrow \\\\ell^+\\\\ell^- \\\\) via \\( bb\\\\ell\\\\ell \\\\) four-fermion contact interaction. These processes are identified by the following IDs: - hepkg:process:b-to-s-ll-fcnc - hepkg:process:qq-to-ll-ci. The information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper: 1. 'The analysis targets the \\( b \\\\rightarrow s \\\\ell^+\\\\ell^- \\\\) flavor-changing neutral current transition.' 2. 'The analysis also targets the \\( q\\\\bar{q} \\\\rightarrow \\\\ell^+\\\\ell^- \\\\) process via the \\( bb\\\\ell\\\\ell \\\\) four-fermion contact interaction.' Therefore, the analysis 2506.13565 targets 2 distinct physics processes.\", \"papers_from\": \"\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2506.13565"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.049, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:b-to-s-ll-fcnc", "hepkg:process:qq-to-ll-ci"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:642bba0349759b812338a766", "hepkg:evidence:6ee29db472c10f926dfcd0d7"], "seen_values": ["2506.13565", "contact", "current", "flavor-changing", "four-fermion", "hepkg:process:b-to-s-ll-fcnc", "hepkg:process:qq-to-ll-ci", "interaction", "neutral", "physics_process", "result_targets_process", "transition", "via"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9300, "completion_tokens": 509, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 20.80857291817665, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 20.80857291817665, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9809.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
