{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-291be4d6", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2207.12246 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2207.12246 defines 8 region selection requirements. These include:\n- Events counted in the y_A vs y_C correlation region dominated by DPE events\n- Events counted outside the shaded upper-right area and outside the elliptical elastic signal region, in the x vs theta_x plane\n- Track ≥1 mm from the beam-screen shadow (beam-screen cut)\n- Track ≥60 μm from the beam-side edge of the detector (fiducial edge cut)\n- x (A-side vs C-side) position difference within 3.5 sigma of the simulated resolution\n- x vs local angle theta_x inside a 3.5 sigma ellipse (Figure 4)\n- y (A-side vs C-side) acollinearity band of 2 mm width\n- y vs local angle theta_y band of 40 μrad width", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.12246"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:310298bb642b888bf481827e", "hepkg:evidence:37bef74fc3631b020b78feb1", "hepkg:evidence:39d4b8916f076e64c1a78422", "hepkg:evidence:513e3c741062b549da127fef", "hepkg:evidence:6f1dc721f1c554191275ea70", "hepkg:evidence:72ea1c6711b32fd3a76a5344", "hepkg:evidence:97d79b98f7f6501cea831b9e", "hepkg:evidence:b92d3d62114a513481391837"], "seen_values": ["1", "2", "2207.12246", "3.5", "4", "40", "6", "60", "a-side", "acollinearity", "and", "angle", "area", "band", "beam-screen", "beam-side", "c-side", "correlation", "counted", "cut", "detector", "difference", "dominated", "dpe", "edge", "elastic", "ellipse", "elliptical", "events", "fiducial", "figure", "from", "i