{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-5b0cffae", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects does analysis 2303.15340 define?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2303.15340 defines the following detector objects:\n\n- $b$-tagged jet (MV2c10, 70% efficiency working point)\n- Jet, particle level (anti-kT R=0.4, excluding neutrinos)\n- Particle-level (dressed) electron\n- Particle-level (dressed) muon\n- Reconstructed electron\n- Reconstructed jet\n- Reconstructed muon\n\nThese definitions are specific to the analysis and are used in the context of the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2303.15340", "2309.14442", "2402.08486"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2303.15340"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.031}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:bjet_reco", "hepkg:object:electron_particle", "hepkg:object:electron_reco", "hepkg:object:jet_particle", "hepkg:object:jet_reco", "hepkg:object:muon_particle", "hepkg:object:muon_reco"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1df3efb9fc2849b2e84445f3", "hepkg:evidence:200a7ba3cc69f66d60769f58", "hepkg:evidence:2fbccb290c511c116c66ba1e", "hepkg:evidence:4f5640c7fde5712e08a6ed70", "hepkg:evidence:52f1fdd665bd0a1ebbcfc1a3", "hepkg:evidence:77004606a43617b2d404d60a", "hepkg:evidence:d126ed422be9f32d6e09fe61"], "seen_values": ["-tagged", "0.4", "2303.1534", "2303.15340", "7", "70", "anti-kt", "detector_object", "dressed", "efficiency", "electron", "excluding", "hepkg:object:bjet_reco", "hepkg:object:electron_particle", "hepkg:object:electron_reco", "hepkg:object:jet_particle", "hepkg:object:jet_reco", "hepkg:object:muon_particle", "hepkg:object:muon_reco", "jet", "level", "muon", "mv2c10", "neutrinos", "particle", "particle-level", "point", "reconstructed",