{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-65fdd3c5", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2506.13565 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2506.13565 measures the following observables:\n\n- Dilepton invariant mass (m_ll) spectrum in ee and mumu channels, by b-tagged jet multiplicity.\n- Ratio of differential dilepton production cross sections R(μμ/ee) vs dilepton mass.\n\nThese details are supported by the following evidence from the paper:\n\n- For the dilepton invariant mass spectrum: 'Dilepton invariant mass (m_ll) spectrum in ee and mumu channels, by b-tagged jet multiplicity.'\n- For the ratio of differential dilepton production cross sections: 'Ratio of differential dilepton production cross sections R(μμ/ee) vs dilepton mass.'", "answered": true, "papers": ["2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2506.13565"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:dilepton-mass-spectrum", "hepkg:observable:lepton-flavor-ratio"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:33b5959fa573a96730fccd73", "hepkg:evidence:bbf77ea26e746ae3fbc86dca", "hepkg:evidence:f9c344cac1472515aa35b415"], "seen_values": ["2506.13565", "and", "b-tagged", "channels", "cross", "differential", "dilepton", "hepkg:observable:dilepton-mass-spectrum", "hepkg:observable:lepton-flavor-ratio", "invariant", "jet", "m_ll", "mass", "multiplicity", "mumu", "observable", "production", "ratio", "result_measures_observable", "sections", "spectrum"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9259, "completion_tokens": 386, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 14.33514279127121, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged"