{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-c2806613", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many quantities does analysis 2010.14293 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2010.14293 reports 12 distinct quantities, including exclusions for gluino and squark masses, and the maximum local discrepancy in validation regions. \n\nHere are the quantities:\n\n- Gluino mass exclusion for massless neutralino: 2220 GeV\n- Gluino mass exclusion for most favourable X (mass-splitting ratio): 2210 GeV\n- Gluino mass lower limit for small neutralino masses: 2300 GeV\n- Maximum local discrepancy in validation regions: 2.6 sigma\n- Neutralino and gluino mass exclusion near diagonal: 900 GeV\n- Neutralino and squark mass exclusion near diagonal: 600 GeV\n- Neutralino mass exclusion at fixed squark mass 1300 GeV: 800 GeV\n- Neutralino mass exclusion near diagonal at gluino mass ~1000 GeV: 950 GeV\n- Neutralino mass exclusion using optimised BDT regions at gluino mass ~1700 GeV: 1160 GeV\n- Squark mass exclusion for massless neutralino: 1310 GeV\n- Squark mass exclusion for most favourable X (mass-splitting ratio): 1350 GeV\n\nThese quantities are derived from the analysis reported in the paper.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2010.14293 reports 12 distinct quantities, including exclusions for gluino and squark masses, and the maximum local discrepancy in validation regions. Here are the quantities:\\n\\n- Gluino mass exclusion for massless neutralino: 2220 GeV\\n- Gluino mass exclusion for most favourable X (mass-splitting ratio): 2210 GeV\\n- Gluino mass lower limit for small neutralino masses: 2300 GeV\\n- Maximum local discrepancy in validation regions: 2.6 sigma\\n- Neutralino and gluino mass exclusion near diagonal: 900 GeV\\n- Neutralino and squark mass exclusion near diagonal: 600 GeV\\n- Neutralino mass exclusion at fixed squark mass 1300 GeV: 800 GeV\\n- Neutralino mass exclusion near diagonal at gluino mass ~1000 GeV: 950 GeV\\n- Neutralino mass exclusion using optimised BDT regions at gluino mass ~1700 GeV: 1160 GeV\\n- Squark mass exclusion for massless neutralino: 1310 GeV\\n- Squark mass exclusion for most favourable X (mass-splitting ratio): 1350 GeV\", \"papers_from\": \"set_1\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2010.14293"], "predicate": "result_reports_quantity"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.062, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:04232fcb307e60e5eb3afc84", "hepkg:evidence:1258a9cbcb7e9c74dc7ea31a", "hepkg:evidence:2bc6281f236e9a5677de4698", "hepkg:evidence:49352533ab68fd976ca90093", "hepkg:evidence:52fff0279cdf653ca67bf216", "hepkg:evidence:54f49528b27e90e3743b70c7", "hepkg:evidence:560cb05d1c57cf511ffff1ec", "hepkg:evidence:5f9ca1d275633a6c326c3050", "hepkg:evidence:68906e009afd9abe11f532b2", "hepkg:evidence:89ff827056e7452061e0d6ca", "hepkg:evidence:e9c9d60be07545b18278e8df"], "seen_values": ["1", "1000", "116", "1160", "13", "1300", "131", "1310", "135", "1350", "17", "1700", "2.6", "2010.14293", "221", "2210", "222", "2220", "23", "2300", "6", "600", "8", "800", "9", "900", "95", "950", "and", "bdt", "diagonal", "discrepancy", "exclusion", "favourable", "fixed", "for", "gev", "gluino", "limit", "local", "lower", "mass", "mass-splitting", "masses", "massless", "maximum", "most", "near", "neutralino", "none", "optimised", "quantity", "ratio", "regions", "result_reports_quantity", "sigma", "small", "squark", "unit", "using", "validation", "value"], "verification_score": 0.9375, "unsupported_claims": ["12"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9885, "completion_tokens": 657, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 25.455518