{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-ca8052a9", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2001.06899 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2001.06899 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- Background (ttbar, single top, diboson) normalization uncertainty\n- Gluon splitting rate uncertainty\n- Heavy-flavor tagging efficiency scale factor uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale and resolution (JES/JER) correction uncertainty\n- Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss) selection efficiency uncertainty\n- PDF and mu_R, mu_F scale uncertainty (unfolding correction)\n- Parton shower and hadronization modeling uncertainty (Pythia vs Herwig++)\n- Pileup weighting uncertainty\n- Statistical uncertainty of MC M_SV template shapes\n- b jet M_SV template shape correction uncertainty", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2001.06899"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:b_jet_msv_shape_correction", "hepkg:systematic:background_rate_normalization", "hepkg:systematic:gluon_splitting", "hepkg:systematic:hf_tagging_efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:jes_jer", "hepkg:systematic:met_selection_efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:parton_shower_hadronization_model", "hepkg:systematic:pdf_scale_variation", "hepkg:systematic:pileup_weighting", "hepkg:systematic:template_statistics"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:22aacafa72d5703fc1473cb9", "hepkg:evidence:2b37e3d54d1e432523f49a1d", "hepkg:evidence:3168359c1d904c1caa11bb86", "hepkg:evidence:68cc9f43715596f759dca513", "hepkg:evidence:6a720291b1e6fc13a52b39b5", "hepkg:evidence:aeb55882de1e91893ab35bb3", "hepkg:evidence:b7e63f59da9abb79e95f5a40", "hepkg:eviden