{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49058", "qid": "gen-paper-f6abec8a", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2401.07090 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2401.07090 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- Cabibbo-suppressed background\n- Combinatorial background\n- Misidentified-hadron peaking background (electron channel)\n- Other b hadron decays background\n- Partially reconstructed background (B*0/+ -> K*(892)0/+ X)\n- Resonant background leakage (J/psi, psi(2S) radiative tail)\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated in the context of the analysis reported in the paper 2401.07090.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2401.07090"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.07090"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:cabibbo_suppressed", "hepkg:background:combinatorial", "hepkg:background:misid_hadron", "hepkg:background:other_b_hadron", "hepkg:background:partially_reconstructed", "hepkg:background:resonant_leakage"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0f3bf43be43cf2727d10c671", "hepkg:evidence:5dcbe38e07c0e6022c308203", "hepkg:evidence:7c4339e2ff28f424556cae4f", "hepkg:evidence:b9d9a48379b426a0214ac364", "hepkg:evidence:bf46673af4919fa703bb8bd9", "hepkg:evidence:e59bee9a99804bf6ced4d014"], "seen_values": ["0", "2", "2401.0709", "2401.07090", "892", "background", "cabibbo-suppressed", "channel", "combinatorial", "decays", "electron", "hadron", "hepkg:background:cabibbo_suppressed", "hepkg:background:combinatorial", "hepkg:background:misid_hadron", "hepkg:background:other_b_hadron", "hepkg:background:partially_reconstructed", "hepkg:background:resonant_leakage", "leakage", "misidentified-hadron", "other", "partially", "peaking", "psi", "radiative", "